{"sha": "1c0b2cbea6976b7c5405e2719fe0da172a109dcbcdd1a413d82edd6a8ceefa0b", "body": ["\\textbf{7.} $u_C(0^+) = U_0$（$u_C$ 连续：电流有限）；", "$u_C'(0^+) = i(0^+)/C = 0$（$i_L$ 连续，且此前为零）。", "", "\\textbf{8.} $m\\ddot x = -k(x + x_{\\text{eq}}) - \\alpha\\dot x + mg$，其中", "$kx_{\\text{eq}} = mg$：$m\\ddot x + \\alpha\\dot x + kx = 0$。", "", "\\textbf{9.} $\\omega_0 = \\sqrt{k/m}$，$Q = \\sqrt{km}/\\alpha$；$x \\leftrightarrow", "q$，$\\dot x \\leftrightarrow i$，$m \\leftrightarrow L$，$\\alpha \\leftrightarrow", "R$，$k \\leftrightarrow 1/C$。", "", "\\textbf{10.} $\\omega_0 = \\sqrt{22000/350} = \\qty{7.93}{rad/s}$，$f_0 =", "\\qty{1.26}{Hz}$；$\\alpha_c = 2\\sqrt{km} = \\qty{5.55e3}{N.s/m}$。", "", "\\textbf{11.} $Q = 2775/4000 = 0.69$，$\\xi = 0.72$：准周期的，", "略小于临界阻尼。", "", "\\textbf{12.} $\\tau = 2Q/\\omega_0 = \\qty{0.18}{s}$；$\\omega = \\omega_0\\sqrt{1", "- \\xi^2} = \\qty{5.5}{rad/s}$，$T = \\qty{1.1}{s}$。", "", "\\textbf{13.} 超调量 $\\exp(-\\pi \\times 0.72/0.69) = \\exp(-3.3) = 3.8\\%$：", "越过平衡位置后仅有一次小幅回升，随即静止 --- 十分舒适。", "", "\\textbf{14.} $R = \\sqrt{L/C}/Q = 316/0.69 = \\qty{455}{\\ohm}$。", "", "\\textbf{15.} $Q = 2775/1200 = 2.3$，$\\xi = 0.22$；$\\omega = 0.976\\omega_0$，", "$T = \\qty{0.81}{s}$；$\\tau = 2Q/\\omega_0 = \\qty{0.58}{s}$。", "", "\\textbf{16.} $\\eu^{-T/\\tau} = \\eu^{-1.39} = 0.25$：每次回弹都是", "前一次的四分之一；$0.25^3 = 1.6\\%$：可见的回弹共三次。", "", "\\textbf{17.} $x(0) = -x_0$，$\\dot x(0) = 0$；能量 $\\tfrac12 kx_0^2 =", "0.5 \\times 22000 \\times 0.0025 = \\qty{28}{J}$，以热量形式", "在阻尼器的油中耗散。", "", "\\textbf{18.} $v \\approx x_0\\omega_0 = 0.05 \\times 7.93 = \\qty{0.40}{m/s}$；", "阻尼力 $\\alpha v \\approx 1200 \\times 0.40 = \\qty{480}{N}$。", "", "\\textbf{19.} 当 $Q = \\tfrac12$ 时，回归过程为 $(1 + \\omega_0 t)\\eu^{-\\omega_0", "t}$，它渐近地缓慢趋近平衡：最后几毫米需要很长时间。一个", "略欠阻尼系统（$\\xi \\approx 0.7$）超调几个", "百分点，但能更快地进入并保持在允许误差带之内。", "", "\\textbf{20.} $\\exp(-\\pi \\times 0.22/0.976) = \\exp(-0.70) = 50\\%$，与", "$3.8\\%$ 相比：磨损的汽车会越过平衡位置回弹一半。", "", "\\textbf{21.} $\\delta = \\ln 4 = 1.39$（两次，结果一致）；$\\xi =", "\\delta/\\sqrt{4\\pi^2 + \\delta^2} = 1.39/6.43 = 0.215$，$Q = 1/2\\xi = 2.3$：", "即磨损后的数值。", "", "\\textbf{22.} $-\\ln 0.038 = 3.27 = \\pi\\xi/\\sqrt{1 - \\xi^2}$，故 $\\xi =", "3.27/\\sqrt{\\pi^2 + 3.27^2} = 0.72$，$Q = 0.69$。", "", "\\textbf{23.} 能量 $\\propto$ 振幅$^2$：每个", "周期剩余 $0.25^2 = 6\\%$，故每个准周期耗散 $94\\%$。", "", "\\textbf{24.} $R = 316/2.3 = \\qty{137}{\\ohm}$。在变量 $\\omega_0 t$", "中，标准方程只含 $Q$：两个具有相同 $Q$ 的系统", "描出的曲线相同。", "", "\\textbf{25.} 仅品质因数 $Q$（或 $\\xi$）即可决定形状；设计者", "通常以 $Q \\approx 0.7$（$\\xi \\approx 0.7$）为目标；若可见", "的回弹多于一次，则 $Q$ 远大于 $1$：阻尼器已磨损。", "\\end{solution}", ""]}